This crate is an original implementation for nv-rs of the role ShowOff xNVSE plays for mods
(ADR-0016's "later built-ins"). It contains no code of the plugin and no decompiled code, and
none was read for it: it is written from public behaviour and documentation only.

Plugin: ShowOff xNVSE, release 1.84 is the target (the owner's list had 1.83). Opcode block
0x3c93. DLL file name ShowOffNVSE.dll as seen in the owner's installation. Nexus mod 72541.

Sources used (2026-11-14): none beyond xNVSE's documented plugin interface. No public source
repository was found (GitHub repository and code searches return nothing), and its Nexus page
and GECK Wiki category were not read (bot blocks answer HTTP 403; no workaround was attempted).

Licence check: not recorded. The author and licence are not known from any document read, so
this crate takes nothing but facts (names, opcode base, behaviour as publicly documented) and
builds no command until its documentation is read and its licence terms are noted here.

Unverified: the plugin name handed to xNVSE (ShowOff NVSE Plugin) and the version number
(184). They are inert while ANSWERS_INSTALLED is false.
